            "verseId": "2SA.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Dee-bid ben kä Ma-na-yim. Kä cu Ɛ̈b-ca-lom Jɔr-dɛn jiɛth kɛnɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl diaal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä täämɛ cu Ɛ̈b-ca-lom Ä-ma-tha la̱th wi̱i̱ rɛ̈m kɛ gua̱a̱th Yo-ab. Kä Ä-ma-tha ɛ gat wutdä mi cɔali Yith-ra raan I-thɛ-rɛl, mëë ci Ä-bi-gal, nya Na-ɣac, nyiman Dhɛ-ru-yaa, man Yo-ab kuɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl kɛ Ɛ̈b-ca-lom pua̱t kä Gil-yad.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
